\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The polynomial-verifier characterization is equivalent theorem content and is not used circularly to define <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> here.</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> respects the positive codomain required of time bounds at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> and leaves polynomial time unchanged.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"83a4535946978ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"83a4535946978ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NTIME}$ (nondeterministic time classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{NTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}np}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{NTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":888,"backlinks":[{"id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NP}$ (nondeterministic polynomial-time class, see [[73-df-binary-np]])"},{"id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\math